[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) was filed as one issue with one parser fix. Its reports hold three
problems. Engineering closed #4471 on 5 October: the parser is fixed, and the booking-v3 hint
will not be fixed because the form is retired. The third problem has no fix.

<Callout kind="warn">
#4471 is closed, but the one-day moves are still live. They need their own investigation.
</Callout>

## The split

<SplitTable
  ticket={4471}
  tickets={{
